# Line endings are LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every
# machine, matching X Omni's convention.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows rewrites endings on checkout,
# and any tool that writes a file back with the other convention makes git
# report every line as changed. A ~700-line change once showed up as ~8,700,
# which hides the real diff and turns review into guesswork.
#
# PowerShell scripts are LF here too; X Omni has run its launchers that way
# for months.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.db binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
